{"about_the_game":"Step into the chilling world of <strong>Whispering Death</strong>, a survival horror game with intricate puzzle elements that will keep you on the edge of your seat. In this game, you play as a man who wakes up in a nightmarish realm, stripped of his memories and haunted by the unknown. Your goal is to remember who you are and find a way out of this terrifying place.<br><br>Navigate through a frightful environment teeming with monstrous creatures and sinister entities that thirst for your demise. The game masterfully blends storytelling, and puzzle-solving, ensuring a gripping experience that challenges both your wits and nerves.<br><br><strong>Whispering Death</strong> stands out with its procedurally generated items, offering players a unique experience each time they play. This feature ensures that no two playthroughs are the same, demanding new strategies and approaches every time you dive into the horror.<br><br><strong>Prepare yourself for a survival horror experience like no other, where every corner hides a new threat and every step could be your last.</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dormant Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802460/e753723b173fe42f7388e8560c455672c478e583.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802460/ab7bed111d4ea298cdf9074e96959552fcc7b925.jpg"},{"name":"Seeming Freedom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802460/848ad43e560c91e34441c35e6bc4b72edcc82efa.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802460/27577eaaf0069947a7453e885163573ed78aa29c.jpg"},{"name":"Strange Tool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2802460/78bca418294428aa34156f2c7c62d291f6bb5d82.jpg"},{"name":"Burned Computer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity